    "itemBodyHtml": "<div class=\"row\">\n\t<div class=\"span6\"><div class=\"passageContent\" xml:base=\"VF581001_s.xml\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"passage-intro\" id=\"sr122\">Today you will research fossils. You will read the article “Miss Me?” Then you will read an article “Clues to Ancient Life” and view the video <i>Croc Fossil Found in Cave</i>. As you review these sources, you will gather information and answer questions about fossils so you can write an essay.</p></div></div>\n    \t<div class=\"stimulus\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"passage-scrolling passage440\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"passageContent\" xml:base=\"VF496993.xml\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><div class=\"stimulus_reference\"> <div class=\"passage\"> <div class=\"prose style:1\"> <p class=\"directions-passage\" id=\"sr\">Watch the video <em>Croc Fossil Found in Cave.</em> Then answer the questions.</p> </div> </div> </div></div><div class=\"abbi-video\"><div id=\"video6de45\" class=\"videoaudio\"></div></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"copyright-tm\">Ngdm/National Geographic Stock</p></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"span6\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><h4>Part A</h4></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"stem_paragraph\" id=\"c1\">What is the central idea of the video <i>Croc Fossil Found in Cave</i>?</p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"int-choice-list choice_list \" data-module=\"ChoiceInteraction\" data-maxchoices=\"1\" data-minchoices=\"1\" data-identifier=\"interaction_RESPONSE_A\">\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_e8c6b\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_e8c6b\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tA.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c2\">Scientists need to start looking for unexplored areas to make new discoveries.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_9122a\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_9122a\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tB.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c3\">Amazing discoveries have been made in caves in the Dominican Republic.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_6e58e\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi3\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_6e58e\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi3\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tC.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c4\">Freshwater caves are a wonderful place to find unknown species.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_bbeb6\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi4\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_bbeb6\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi4\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tD.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c5\">Funding for new explorations needs to be a focus for scientists.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><h4>Part B</h4></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"stem_paragraph\" id=\"c7\">Which <b class=\"stressed_text_1\">three </b>details from the video <b class=\"stressed_text_1\">best </b>support the answer to Part A?</p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"int-choice-list choice_list \" data-module=\"ChoiceInteraction\" data-maxchoices=\"0\" data-minchoices=\"1\" data-identifier=\"interaction_RESPONSE_B\">\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_0c46d\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_0c46d\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tA.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c8\">The crocodile was found where crocodiles have never been seen.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_7e4b2\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_7e4b2\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tB.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c9\">The end of a crocodile snout stuck out of the sand.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_5b2a8\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_5b2a8\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi3\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tC.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c10\">The fossils were in great shape because of the cold water.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_4b92d\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_4b92d\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi4\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tD.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c11\">There are other caves that are easier to get into.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_28a30\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_28a30\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi5\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tE.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c12\">It is hard to find good complete bones in the dirt.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_a37f0\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_a37f0\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi6\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tF.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c13\">Remains of many different types of animals were found.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"checkbox\" for=\"choice_a8d54\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control int-choice-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"choice_a8d54\" class=\"checkbox\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi7\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tG.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-desc\"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c14\">The entrance to the cave was in a remote area.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n",
